# Node: atomic.ByBuiltinRule.SqrtNonzeroFromPositiveArg / strict order
# Run: litex -f examples/proof_nodes/atomic/by_builtin_rule/not_equal_sqrt_nonzero_from_positive.lit
#
# When: `have a R+` and `0 < a`.
# After: `sqrt(a) != 0` from the positive-arg builtin.
# Note: `sqrt(a) > 0` still needs `sqrt(a) $in R+`, which is not automatic yet.

have a R+
0 < a
sqrt(a) != 0
